      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive clinicians and reception assistants"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners frequently praise the veterinary doctors and technicians in Oak Park, specifically highlighting Dr. Cheryl, Jacqueline, and Dr. Melissa for their patience and warmth. Reviewers appreciate that practitioners take time to answer routine questions. While most interactions are positive, a couple of clients noted frustration with front desk scheduling and managerial communication."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 28,
      "title": {
        "en": "Calm handling for anxious pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients consistently observe that veterinarians and assistants handle nervous or fearful cats and dogs with genuine patience. Reviewers note that staff offer treats, gentle distractions, and quiet reassurance during routine examinations and vaccinations. Two visitors noted added fees or difficulty managing highly distressed pets, but the majority feel animals are treated kindly."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "waiting",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 9,
      "title": {
        "en": "Same-day bookings alongside scheduling delays"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers frequently report securing same-day appointments when their pets require urgent attention for ear infections, sudden illness, or basic wellness checks. Many pet parents appreciate the punctual scheduling and swift check-in. However, two reviewers experienced discrepancies between arranged drop-off times and front desk records, resulting in unexpected delays."
      }
    }
  ],
